        "thought_text": "Iterate through each cell and identify potential image borders using '+' characters, ensuring that the identified borders form valid images according to the given rules. Specifically, check that the identified borders enclose a rectangular area with '+' characters forming the outer boundary and that the inner area contains only allowed characters. If a valid image is found, mark it for removal and update the grid accordingly.",
